#### FILTER keeps rows matching a >10 criteria

- Verify: FILTER keeps rows matching a >10 criteria
   - Expected: _disp(sh, "A1") equals `15`
   - Expected: _disp(sh, "A2") equals `25`
   - Expected: _disp(sh, "A3") equals ``


